// A call of a generic function is checked against what its body does with
// the arguments. The error is reported at the call, with a note on the line
// in the body that can't take them.
// expect-error: No function called '+' found that matches the arguments 'String, Int'
fn inc(x) => x + 1;
fn shout(s) => inc(s) ++ "!";
shout("a");
